Build the library for wasm32-wasip1 (no new behaviour on native targets)

- mimalloc, libc and memmap2 move to non-wasm target dependencies: mimalloc
  is only the CLI's global allocator, libc only the terminal-width ioctl
  (no terminal on wasm: None), memmap2 only maps an export file (read whole
  on wasm).
- on_big_stack (lib.rs) runs the inductive pass and the serial checker
  inline on wasm32, which has no threads; on native targets it spawns the
  same scoped thread with the 2 GiB STACK_SIZE and joins it, as before.
Upstream: none (no related issue or PR; issues #2-#12 are soundness, OOM and
loose-bvar reports, checked 2026-11-22).

